{
  "an4.200:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.200 ",
  "an4.200:0.2": "20. The Great Chapter ",
  "an4.200:0.3": "Fondness ",
  "an4.200:1.1": "“Mendicants, these four things are born. ",
  "an4.200:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.200:1.3": "Fondness is born of fondness, ",
  "an4.200:1.4": "hate is born of fondness, ",
  "an4.200:1.5": "fondness is born of hate, and ",
  "an4.200:1.6": "hate is born of hate. ",
  "an4.200:2.1": "And how is fondness born of fondness? ",
  "an4.200:2.2": "It’s when someone likes, loves, and cares for an individual. ",
  "an4.200:2.3": "Others treat them with liking, love, and care. ",
  "an4.200:2.4": "They think: ",
  "an4.200:2.5": "‘These others like the individual I like.’ ",
  "an4.200:2.6": "And so fondness for them springs up. ",
  "an4.200:2.7": "That’s how fondness is born of fondness. ",
  "an4.200:3.1": "And how is hate born of fondness? ",
  "an4.200:3.2": "It’s when someone likes, loves, and cares for an individual. ",
  "an4.200:3.3": "Others treat them with disliking, loathing, and detestation. ",
  "an4.200:3.4": "They think: ",
  "an4.200:3.5": "‘These others dislike the individual I like.’ ",
  "an4.200:3.6": "And so hate for them springs up. ",
  "an4.200:3.7": "That’s how hate is born of fondness. ",
  "an4.200:4.1": "And how is fondness born of hate? ",
  "an4.200:4.2": "It’s when someone dislikes, loathes, and detests an individual. ",
  "an4.200:4.3": "Others treat them with disliking, loathing, and detestation. ",
  "an4.200:4.4": "They think: